  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint (+1), moderate (+2/+3), or strong (+4/+5) Protection; <strong>CL</strong> 3rd (+1), 6th (+2), 9th (+3), 12th (+4), or 15th (+5)<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> ring; <strong>Price</strong> 3,500 gp (+1), 14,000 gp (+2), 31,500 gp (+3), 56,000 gp (+4), or 87,500 gp (+5); <strong>Weight</strong> 1&nbsp;lb.</p>\n<p>Often used by those with money to spare and a need to wear more magical items, these slender silver rings grant a deflection bonus to armor class and an equal resistance bonus to all saving throws.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nForge Charm, Protection sphere (Energy Resistance (aegis, ward)); <strong>Cost</strong> 1,750 gp (+1), 7,000 gp (+2), 15,750 gp (+3), 28,000 gp (+4), or 43,750 gp (+5)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/charms#toc39\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
